               lacks. It is deliberately not phrased as a refusal the person can
               act on, because there is nothing for them to do differently. */
            'batch_asset_slot_unsupported',
            'invalid_intake_item', 'invalid_intake_payload', 'invalid_intake_teams',
            /* The Create Post name fields carry maxlength, and the state
               normaliser slices at the same number, so the dialog cannot
